  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UEGCL Institutional Support for Hydropower O&amp;M Excellence</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to UEGCL Hydropower Operation and Maintenance Excellence (HOME) Programme. Expected impact: Improved socio-economic development in Uganda through higher availability and access to electricity. The expected effects of the Programme for the target group are (Outcome): 
i.	UEGCL established as a professional operator of its large hydropower plants
ii.	Increased competence level of UEGCL operation and maintenance staff</narrative>
  </description>
